\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> (variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\)</span> (atomic-formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 是候选语法字符串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。公式构造加足括号，递归以字符串长度为良基。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> (variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formulas, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{F\\subseteq\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\subseteq F\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in F)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in F)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F)\n\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\